<title>UK: London silver fixes easier, contango narrows.</title>
<headline>London silver fixes easier, contango narrows.</headline>
<text>
<p>SILVER - Fixed at 481.35 cents vs 490.00 cents Friday. Speculative short position tightening contango.</p>
<p>GOLD - Barely changed at $344.15/$344.65. Fairly quiet but holding gains from Friday.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Just easier, volatile. $470.00/$480.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Firmer at $230.00/$235.00. Awaiting news of Russian export expectations. Volatile, nervous.</p>
</text>
